abstract: A deterministic, point-weighted benchmark toolkit for Chinese Gaokao questions. Engine 0.1.5 separates a subject-neutral harness from versioned benchmark specifications and immutable data packages, with a single scoped primary metric, provider-pinned reproducibility controls, resume support, diagnostic text/vision slices, compact terminal reports, and explicit per-question answer-format instructions. The current 0.0.4 dataset keeps the same 74 choice and fill-in mathematics questions from five 2025 papers while closing every item into an audited_passed owner attestation. The complete dataset package is licensed under CC BY 4.0; the harness and code remain Apache-2.0.

